---
title: SST Teardown
---
flowchart
  Main[[Main Loop]] --> Signals[/SIGINT / SIGTERM/]
  Signals --> Stop[[Stop & Invalidate FSEventStream]]
  Stop --> CloseDir[[Close $INPUT_DIR File Descriptor]]

  CloseDir --> |Failure: EXIT NONZERO| ClosePipe[[Close Pipe]]
  CloseDir --> |Success: EXIT OK| ClosePipe

  ClosePipe --> |Failure: EXIT NONZERO| Reap[[Wait for Child PID]]
  ClosePipe --> |Success: EXIT OK| Reap
  Reap --> |Failure: EXIT NONZERO| Exit([EXIT])
  Reap --> |Success: EXIT OK| Exit([EXIT])
